WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.067
Book, log a call or edit a customer.

00:00:03.767 --> 00:00:09.167
Open the customer. It all starts from their screen. Let's open Bayview Marina.

00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:14.733
Book an appointment. Appointment opens the booking form for this customer.

00:00:15.233 --> 00:00:26.933
Visit, phone call or task. Pick what it is first and the fields follow: a call has a call time and who calls, a task can go to anyone. Then What for, Date, time and Notes.

00:00:27.433 --> 00:00:35.133
Who and where come along. Their name, phone and address are filled in already, and With starts as their salesperson.

00:00:35.633 --> 00:00:40.600
Close it. Close it without booking. Book it would put it on that person's day.

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:45.933
Log a call. Log call writes a conversation down on their Timeline.

00:00:46.433 --> 00:00:51.567
Call, note or email. Phone call, Note or Email: pick what it was.

00:00:52.067 --> 00:00:55.933
What was said. A line or two on what was said or agreed.

00:00:56.433 --> 00:01:02.333
Save it. Save adds it to the Timeline with your name and the time. The tour doesn't press it.

00:01:02.833 --> 00:01:06.000
Close it. The X closes it without saving.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:11.333
Edit their details. Edit opens everything about them in one form.

00:01:11.833 --> 00:01:24.000
Change stage and billing. The same fields as New customer. Move a lead to Customer or Inactive here, switch to monthly invoicing, change terms, salesperson or CSR.

00:01:24.467 --> 00:01:29.700
Save changes. Saves and updates their screen. The tour doesn't save.

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:33.700
Close it. Closes the form; nothing changed.

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:41.833
Start an estimate. Estimate makes a new draft estimate for them and opens it to write. Press it when you're ready to quote.

00:01:42.333 --> 00:01:47.933
That's it. You can play this tour in the app any time: press Help, and ask in your own words.
